  "description_original": "Iznajmljujem stan 47m2, na 12mjeseci. Lokacija Topla 2, 500m od mora, 200m od Doma Zdravlja/SUP-a. Djecja igraonica i kafić na 50m. 3 prodavnice u blizini. Dnevni boravak sa bracnim krevetom i klimom, dvokrevetna soba, kuhinja, hodnik, kupatilo, velika terasa sa parcijalnim pogledom na more i planinu, ljepa bašta i privatna garaža.\nI am renting apartment 47m2, for 12 months. Location Topla 2, 500m from sea, 200m from community Health centre / Police station. Children's playroom and coffee bar within 50m. 3 markets nearby. Living room with king size family bed and air conditioner, separate two-bedded bedroom, kitchen, hallway, bathroom, big balcony with partial sea and mountain view, nice garden and private garage.",
